% must-example.l4
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of the contracts of an L4 file (must-example.l4), written
% by the L4 translator (docs/migration/l4.md, step 3). Each obligation, permission or
% prohibition is a fluent that holds while it is open; the events are L4's, with the day
% L4 gives them as their last place. As L4's evaluator does, a missed deadline is
% noticed when something next happens, and that event does not count towards what
% follows. Each #TRACE of the file is a scenario; the comment above it is L4's result.
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 6.

the events are:
    the contract monthly loan payment starts on day *a day*; known as contract_monthly_loan_payment_starts.
    *a party* does make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* on day *a day*; known as does_make_payment.
    something happens on day *a day*; known as something_happens_on_day.
    *a party* does something on day *a day*; known as does_something_on_day.
    the clock reaches day *a day*; known as the_clock_reaches_day.
    the contract purchase and delivery agreement starts on day *a day*; known as contract_purchase_and_delivery_agreement_starts.
    *a party* does deliver goods with goods description *a goods description* on day *a day*; known as does_deliver_goods.
    the contract payment with late fee starts on day *a day*; known as contract_payment_with_late_fee_starts.
    the contract staged service contract starts on day *a day*; known as contract_staged_service_contract_starts.
    *a party* does provide services with service description *a service description* on day *a day*; known as does_provide_services.
    the contract construction contract workflow starts on day *a day*; known as contract_construction_contract_workflow_starts.
    *a party* does sign contract on day *a day*; known as does_sign_contract.
    the contract lease termination and deposit return starts on day *a day*; known as contract_lease_termination_and_deposit_return_starts.
    *a party* does provide notice with notice content *a notice content* on day *a day*; known as does_provide_notice.
    *a party* does complete repairs with repair description *a repair description* on day *a day*; known as does_complete_repairs.
    *a party* does return security deposit with deposit amount *a deposit amount* on day *a day*; known as does_return_security_deposit.
    the contract landlord repair obligation starts on day *a day*; known as contract_landlord_repair_obligation_starts.

the fluents are:
    monthly loan payment obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_monthly_loan_payment_1.
    purchase and delivery agreement obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_purchase_and_delivery_agreement_1.
    payment with late fee obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_payment_with_late_fee_1.
    staged service contract obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_staged_service_contract_1.
    construction contract workflow obliges *a party* to sign contract by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_construction_contract_workflow_1.
    lease termination and deposit return obliges *a party* to provide notice with notice content *a notice content* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_lease_termination_and_deposit_return_1.
    landlord repair obligation obliges *a party* to complete repairs with repair description *a repair description* by day *a due day* as its first obligation; known as o_landlord_repair_obligation_1.
    the contract is fulfilled; known as the_contract_is_fulfilled.
    the contract is breached by *a party* missing the deadline of day *a deadline*; known as the_contract_is_breached_by_missing.
    purchase and delivery agreement obliges *a party* to deliver goods with goods description *a goods description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_purchase_and_delivery_agreement_2.
    payment with late fee obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_payment_with_late_fee_2.
    staged service contract obliges *a party* to provide services with service description *a service description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_staged_service_contract_2.
    construction contract workflow obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_construction_contract_workflow_2.
    lease termination and deposit return obliges *a party* to complete repairs with repair description *a repair description* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_lease_termination_and_deposit_return_2.
    landlord repair obligation obliges *a party* to provide notice with notice content *a notice content* by day *a due day* as its second obligation; known as o_landlord_repair_obligation_2.
    the contract is breached; known as the_contract_is_breached.
    staged service contract obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_staged_service_contract_3.
    construction contract workflow obliges *a party* to provide services with service description *a service description* by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_construction_contract_workflow_3.
    lease termination and deposit return obliges *a party* to return security deposit with deposit amount *a deposit amount* by day *a due day* as its third obligation; known as o_lease_termination_and_deposit_return_3.
    construction contract workflow obliges *a party* to make payment with payment amount *a payment amount* by day *a due day* as its fourth obligation; known as o_construction_contract_workflow_4.
    lease termination and deposit return obliges *a party* to return security deposit with deposit amount *a deposit amount* by day *a due day* as its fourth obligation; known as o_lease_termination_and_deposit_return_4.

