% The contract monthly loan payment starts: its first obligations.
when the contract monthly loan payment starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then monthly loan payment obliges the_borrower to make payment with payment amount 10000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract purchase and delivery agreement starts: its first obligations.
when the contract purchase and delivery agreement starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
then purchase and delivery agreement obliges the_buyer to make payment with payment amount 25000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract payment with late fee starts: its first obligations.
when the contract payment with late fee starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 30
then payment with late fee obliges the_borrower to make payment with payment amount 10000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract staged service contract starts: its first obligations.
when the contract staged service contract starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 3
then staged service contract obliges the_client to make payment with payment amount 5000 by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract construction contract workflow starts: its first obligations.
when the contract construction contract workflow starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 7
then construction contract workflow obliges the_contractor to sign contract by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract lease termination and deposit return starts: its first obligations.
when the contract lease termination and deposit return starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 60
then lease termination and deposit return obliges the_tenant to provide notice with notice content "60-day notice of non-renewal" by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The contract landlord repair obligation starts: its first obligations.
when the contract landlord repair obligation starts on day a day
    and a due day = day + 14
then landlord repair obligation obliges the_landlord to complete repairs with repair description "fix leaking roof" by day the due day as its first obligation.

% The first obligation of monthly loan payment: met, or its deadline missed.
when a party does make payment with payment amount a payment amount on day a day
    and monthly loan payment obliges the party to make payment with payment amount the payment amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day <= the due day
then the contract is fulfilled
    and it is not the case that monthly loan payment obliges the party to make payment with payment amount the payment amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

when something happens on day a day
    and monthly loan payment obliges a party to make payment with payment amount a payment amount by day a due day as its first obligation
    and the day > the due day
then the contract is breached by the party missing the deadline of day the due day
    and it is not the case that monthly loan payment obliges the party to make payment with payment amount the payment amount by day the due day as its first obligation.

